<title>POLAND: POLISH KPW CLEARS MOSTOSTAL SIEDLCE FOR TRADE.</title>
<headline>POLISH KPW CLEARS MOSTOSTAL SIEDLCE FOR TRADE.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Securities Commission</p>
<p>(KPW) has cleared for public trade all 7,200,000 shares of</p>
<p>construction firm Mostostal Siedlce, the KPW said in a</p>
<p>statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>The firm seeks to start trade on the bourse's main market</p>
<p>in September.</p>
<p>EARNINGS DATA	     1996		    1995</p>
<p>(in mln of PLN)</p>
<p> Net profit:		 3.4		     4.8</p>
<p> Sales:		    163.8		   122.9</p>
<p>Main Shareholder:</p>
<p>Pierwszy Polski Fundusz Rozwoju - 11.1 pct of shares</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
